[2025.11.21-21.31.51:337][129]LogFabLauncher: Debug payload: [{"id":"2c6db96a-8b9a-49b1-910b-70871b458a7a","path":"C:/ProgramData/Epic/EpicGamesLauncher/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Elegant_Marble-Top_Executive_Desk-2c6db96a/glb","meshes":[{"file":"C:/ProgramData/Epic/EpicGamesLauncher/VaultCache/FabLibrary/Elegant_Marble-Top_Executive_Desk-2c6db96a/glb/executivedesk_83a298361.glb","name":"","material_index":0,"lods":[]}],"materials":[],"native_files":[],"additional_textures":[],"metadata":{"launcher":{"version":"0.0.1","listening_port":24563},"fab":{"assetNamespace":"","listing":{"averageRating":3,"createdAt":"","description":"<p>This executive desk embodies sophistication and durability, perfect for professional or upscale office environments. The desk features a polished marble top, exuding a refined elegance while providing a sturdy, scratch-resistant surface. The base is crafted from rich, dark wood with a fine grain finish, offering ample storage options, including multiple drawers and a cabinet for organizing office essentials. Silver hardware complements the wood's warm tones, adding a modern touch. The seamless blend of classic and contemporary design ensures that this executive desk makes a statement while enhancing productivity. Ideal for executives, professionals, or anyone seeking a blend of functionality and luxury in their workspace.</p>","isAiForbidden":false,"isAiGenerated":false,"lastUpdatedAt":"2025-02-24T11:55:57.004227Z","listingType":"3d-model","media":"https://media.fab.com/image_previews/gallery_images/2a45987d-a7ed-4aa7-8dcb-b1ea3c5d5dd0/fcb6630b-aded-46e8-a296-cca2c57c1805.png","publishedAt":"2024-11-05T22:17:25.952554Z","reviewCount":1,"thumbnail":"https://media.fab.com/image_previews/gallery_images/02a9ad09-bbfc-48d9-bf61-4b99a84f75d2/9f74eddf-1ef5-466a-9e80-2205fea3bbae.png","title":"Elegant Marble-Top Executive Desk","uid":"2c6db96a-8b9a-49b1-910b-70871b458a7a","updatedAt":"","user":{"coverImageUrl":"https://cdn1.epicgames.com/fab/seller/o-p38